# Word of the Day — keep it short

When creating or drafting a Word of the Day entry (단어장):

- Include only: word, POS, short Korean meaning, IPA (+ hangul), **2 collocations**, **1 example** (EN+KO), optional **up to 3 bare synonym words**.
- Do **not** dump dictionary essays, 3+ examples, long synonym explanations (fable/allegory style), or multi-paragraph English definitions.
- Prefer the lean auto pipeline: `backend/scripts/auto-wordofday.js` + `wordofday-format.js`.
- If the user asks to “word of day”, draft the short card first — do not paste a full thesaurus page.
